WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Hello. I'm Nikolaj Coster-Waldau.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.280
I'm a Danish actor.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.840
I'm also a goodwill ambassador for the United Nations Development Program.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.820
How do I see future of the Arctic?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.140
It's complex.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.840
It's such an enormous question to answer.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:29.460
I think, if I had to pick one thing that I believe is very important, it's that,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:35.700
obviously, climate change affects all of us in the whole world,

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:41.480
but whatever solutions, whatever measures we decide to take,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.840
we have to listen and include the people who live in the Arctic.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.400
That is crucial.

